{"resourceIdentifier":"1493","resourceName":"Mangrove restoration and coastal greenbelt protection in the East coast of Aceh and North Sumatra Province, Indonesia","description":"The goal of this project is to increase the environmental carrying capacity of mangrove ecosystems in the east coast of Northern Sumatra for carbon sequestration, natural disaster risk reduction and local livelihood improvement. Ecological improvement, climate change mitigation, economic consideration and local community participation will be the main-stream and the spirit of this proposed project. By helping to ensure that the mangrove and more generally the coastal green-belt are well maintained, the project will support Sumatra’s future ecological, social and economic development. During the first 3-4 years of mangrove restoration, the project will restore more than 5,000 ha of degraded mangrove.  Undergoing validation and verification to the CCB Standards: public comment period – 19 August – 18 September 2019. The following documents are undergoing public comment:    1)  CCB_PROJ_DESC_ENG_DRAFT_1493_31JUL2019    2)  CCB_PROJ_DESC_SUM_BAH_DRAFT_1493_31JUL2019    3)  CCB_MON_REP_ENG_","location":{"latitude":4.650000,"longitude":97.590000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-04-06","endExclusive":"2020-05-07","endInclusive":"2020-05-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1493"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Aceh and North Sumatra provinces"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livelihoods Fund SICAV SIF"},{"type":"string","value":"Paris, France"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1493"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1493"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_RED